        <gr str="369">none </gr>to <gr str="5337">deliver</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="3"> O <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>my <gr str="430">God</gr>, <gr str="518">if </gr>I have <gr str="6213">done </gr>
