      <VERS vnumber="4">
        <gr str="518">If </gr>I have <gr str="1580">rewarded </gr>
        <gr str="7451">evil </gr>unto him that was at <gr str="7999">peace </gr>with me; (yea, I have <gr str="2502">delivered </gr>him that without <gr str="7387">cause </gr>is mine <gr str="6887">enemy</gr>:) </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> Let the <gr str="341">enemy </gr>
