        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> it </STYLE>; yea, let him tread <gr str="7429">down </gr>my <gr str="2416">life </gr>upon the <gr str="776">earth</gr>, and <gr str="7931">lay </gr>mine <gr str="3519">honor </gr>in the <gr str="6083">dust</gr>. <gr str="5542">Selah</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">
        <gr str="6965">Arise</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, in thine <gr str="639">anger</gr>, lift up <gr str="5375">thyself </gr>because of the <gr str="5678">rage </gr>of mine <gr str="6887">enemies</gr>: and <gr str="5782">awake </gr>
