      <VERS vnumber="7"> So shall the <gr str="5712">congregation </gr>of the <gr str="3816">people </gr>compass thee <gr str="5437">about</gr>: for their <gr str="5921">sakes </gr>therefore <gr str="7725">return </gr>thou on <gr str="4791">high</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>shall <gr str="1777">judge </gr>the <gr str="5971">people</gr>: <gr str="8199">judge </gr>me, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, according to my <gr str="6664">righteousness</gr>, and according to mine <gr str="8537">integrity </gr>
