      <VERS vnumber="17"> I will <gr str="3034">praise </gr>the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>according to his <gr str="6664">righteousness</gr>: and will sing <gr str="2167">praise </gr>to the <gr str="8034">name </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>most <gr str="5945">high</gr>. </VERS>
